    <item>
      <title>Text-to-Image System Design</title>
      <link>https://ruokezhang.github.io/en/post/system_design/text_to_image/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 31 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://ruokezhang.github.io/en/post/system_design/text_to_image/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;https://medium.com/pinterest-engineering/building-pinterest-canvas-a-text-to-image-foundation-model-aa34965e84d9&#34; title=&#34;https://medium.com/pinterest-engineering/building-pinterest-canvas-a-text-to-image-foundation-model-aa34965e84d9&#34; rel=&#34;noopener external nofollow noreferrer&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; class=&#34; exturl&#34;&gt;&#xA;    https://medium.com/pinterest-engineering/building-pinterest-canvas-a-text-to-image-foundation-model-aa34965e84d9&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa fa-external-link-alt&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;https://arxiv.org/abs/2603.06453?utm_source=chatgpt.com&#34; title=&#34;https://arxiv.org/abs/2603.06453?utm_source=chatgpt.com&#34; rel=&#34;noopener external nofollow noreferrer&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; class=&#34; exturl&#34;&gt;&#xA;    https://arxiv.org/abs/2603.06453?utm_source=chatgpt.com&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa fa-external-link-alt&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/junfanz1/Awesome-AI-Review/blob/main/System%20Design/GenAI%20System%20Design.md#5-text-to-image&#34; title=&#34;https://github.com/junfanz1/Awesome-AI-Review/blob/main/System%20Design/GenAI%20System%20Design.md#5-text-to-image&#34; rel=&#34;noopener external nofollow noreferrer&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; class=&#34; exturl&#34;&gt;&#xA;    https://github.com/junfanz1/Awesome-AI-Review/blob/main/System%20Design/GenAI%20System%20Design.md#5-text-to-image&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa fa-external-link-alt&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;pinterest-canvas&#34;&gt;Pinterest Canvas&#xA;&lt;a class=&#34;header-anchor&#34; href=&#34;#pinterest-canvas&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;text-to-image&#34;&gt;Text-To-Image&#xA;&lt;a class=&#34;header-anchor&#34; href=&#34;#text-to-image&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Generate images conditioned on both &lt;strong&gt;text prompts&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;reference images&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 id=&#34;1-text-to-image&#34;&gt;1. text-to-image&#xA;&lt;a class=&#34;header-anchor&#34; href=&#34;#1-text-to-image&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Inference&#xA;&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Embed the text prompt to obtain the text embedding&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Feed the noisy target latent and the text embedding into the DiT together to obtain the clean target latent&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;The clean target latent passes through the VAE decoder to produce the image&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Training&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Training data: (text prompt, real image)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Only the DiT is trained. Both the text encoder and the VAE use pretrained weights, and are then frozen&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;The real image passes through the VAE encoder to obtain the real latent. During training, x_t is generated from the real latent&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 id=&#34;2-multimodal-image-editing-tasks&#34;&gt;2. multimodal image editing tasks&#xA;&lt;a class=&#34;header-anchor&#34; href=&#34;#2-multimodal-image-editing-tasks&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stage 2 starts from the trained Stage 1 text-to-image model.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Visual Search</title>
      <link>https://ruokezhang.github.io/en/post/system_design/visual_search/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://ruokezhang.github.io/en/post/system_design/visual_search/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;https://bytebytego.com/courses/machine-learning-system-design-interview/visual-search-system&#34; title=&#34;bytebytego tutorial&#34; rel=&#34;noopener external nofollow noreferrer&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; class=&#34; exturl&#34;&gt;&#xA;    bytebytego tutorial&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa fa-external-link-alt&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;dataset&#34;&gt;dataset&#xA;&lt;a class=&#34;header-anchor&#34; href=&#34;#dataset&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;A query image&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;(n-1) negative images&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;A positive image, i.e., the image most similar to the query image.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;The index label of the positive image among all the images.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;build-dataset&#34;&gt;build dataset&#xA;&lt;a class=&#34;header-anchor&#34; href=&#34;#build-dataset&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;human judgement: humans annotate the most similar image&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;user interaction&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;noisy&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;sparse: may not have click data available for lots of the images&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;generate similar images&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;offline-metrics&#34;&gt;Offline metrics&#xA;&lt;a class=&#34;header-anchor&#34; href=&#34;#offline-metrics&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;mean-reciprocal-rank-mrr&#34;&gt;Mean reciprocal rank (MRR)&#xA;&lt;a class=&#34;header-anchor&#34; href=&#34;#mean-reciprocal-rank-mrr&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;MRR=1/m * sum(1/rank_i)&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
